<i data-commentator="Be'er HaGolah" data-label="ד" data-order="4"></i> On the second [special] Shabbos we take out two scrolls. From the first we read that <i data-commentator="Mishnah Berurah" data-label="ו"></i> week’s regular portion, and from the second we read &lt;i&gt;Zachor es asher <i data-commentator="Mishnah Berurah" data-label="ז"></i> asah lecha Amalek&lt;/i&gt;, and <i data-commentator="Mishnah Berurah" data-label="ח"></i> the haftarah is &lt;i&gt;Pakadti es asher asah Amalek&lt;/i&gt;:
